					"type": "attribute_bonus",
					"attribute": "vision",
					"amount": 2
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "tnDcIt57X55mGMmLu",
			"name": "Ballistic Auto-senses, Sicarian/Ranger Pattern",
			"reference": "B60",
			"local_notes": "Infravision; Acute Vision +2 (applied by the sheet); Telescopic Vision +2.\n\nLore: Longer-focus oculars issued to Skitarii Rangers and Sicarian pattern infiltrators for target marking at range — the same augmetic family as the standard pattern, with an added zoom lens train.\n\nDesign: Infravision (B60, 10) + Acute Vision +2 (B35, 4) + Telescopic Vision +2 (B92, 5/level, 10) = 24 points.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
